					</div>
					<a href="https://bemorefree.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-700 font-medium">
						Visit Website
						<svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
